<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδέω</span></b>  (B), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δεήσω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want</i> or <i>lack of</i> a number, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρακοσίας μυριάδας</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . ἐπιδεούσας ἑπτὰ χιλιάδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.28
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>to be in need</i>
			<i>of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ocell.
				1.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τέχνης ἂν μόνον
			ἐπιδέοι</span> would <i>need</i> nothing <i>ffurther</i>
			but his skill, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				709d
			</span></i>: impers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν δὲ καὶ ἄλλης ἐπιδέῃ βοηθείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Med.
			, <i>to be in want of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				204a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				8.16
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχὴν τριάκοντα
				ἐπιδεομένην ἡμερῶν</span>
			<i>lacking</i> thirty days of its expiry, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				766c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>request,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Lond.
				121.546
			</span></i>.</div>
